Package: taos-shell
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jaylfc <jaylfc25@gmail.com>
Priority: optional
Section: shells
Depends: zsh, zsh-autosuggestions, zsh-syntax-highlighting, starship, fastfetch, fzf, zoxide, eza, bat, ripgrep, fd-find, btop
Description: taOS terminal experience: zsh, starship prompt, fastfetch, login motd
 A colourful zsh setup for every user out of the box: shared history,
 completion, autosuggestions, syntax highlighting, fzf and zoxide, modern
 ls/cat aliases, a starship prompt that needs no Nerd Font, a fastfetch
 config with the taOS logo, and a login motd with a gradient taOS logo and a
 short system summary (the login shows this one block instead of Debian's
 uname line). Debian's 10-uname motd script is diverted and restored on removal.
